Event Signature Raised when <code>WhenLoaded</code> <code>Action</code> GL context initialized. <code>WhenClosing</code> <code>Action</code> Window is about to close. <code>WhenMoved</code> <code>Action&lt;SKPoint&gt;</code> Window moved. <code>WhenResized</code> <code>Action&lt;SKSize&gt;</code> Window resized. <code>WhenStateChanged</code> <code>Action&lt;WindowState&gt;</code> Minimize/maximize/normal. <code>WhenFocusChanged</code> <code>Action&lt;bool&gt;</code> Focus gained/lost. <pre><code>window.WhenLoaded += () =&gt; Console.WriteLine("Ready");
window.WhenClosing += () =&gt; SaveLayout();
window.WhenResized += size =&gt; Layout.Recalculate(size);
</code></pre>

Property Default Description <code>PumpThreadName</code> <code>null</code> → <code>HandyWindow-&lt;Title&gt;</code> Name of the pump thread. <code>CustomWindowOptions</code> <code>null</code> Overrides the whole <code>WindowOptions</code>. <p>Custom chrome</p> <pre><code>var cfg = WindowConfiguration.Default with
{
    Title = "Chat",
    Size = new SKSize(420, 700),
    IsResizable = true,
    IsTitleBarVisible = false,
    Icon = SKImage.FromEncodedData("Assets/chat.png")
};
</code></pre>
